  "sourceTitle": "Poached Egg & Toast",
  "sourceText": "Poached Egg & Toast\nBy: Stephan Schaff\nPublished: Friday, October 29, 2010 - 12:16pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 egg\n3 cups bacon grease\n1 slice of bread\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Heat bacon grease on a low heat to 90-100 degrees in a 8\" egg pan 2 Drop in egg 3 Let poach until egg is cooked soft 4 Toast a slice of bread 5 Place egg on top of toast",
